To do:
  - There is no user radiator. Radiator Software's radiator.service, and the
    guide, run Radiator as radiator:
      sudo groupadd -r radiator
      sudo useradd -r -g radiator -d /var/lib/radiator -s /usr/sbin/nologin radiator
  - There is no radiator.service. The guide starts Radiator with 'systemctl
    start radiator', and partition mode restarts it that way: copy
    goodies/radiator.service from Radiator's source to /etc/systemd/system/,
    with its paths changed to those of your radiusd.

